  "post_content": "<p>(10 fotos) Las participantes del Programa Sara de Cruz Roja han iniciado, en la Casa de la Cultura de Onda, el taller de competencias digitales para la b&uacute;squeda de empleo. El objetivo es facilitar su inserci&oacute;n laboral a trav&eacute;s del uso de las tecnolog&iacute;as de la informaci&oacute;n y la comunicaci&oacute;n (TIC), con sesiones sobre portales de empleo, recursos web para la formaci&oacute;n, programas de tratamiento de textos para elaborar el curr&iacute;culum vitae (CV) o aplicaciones para m&oacute;vil.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0585.jpg\" alt=\"img_0585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0587.jpg\" alt=\"img_0587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0588.jpg\" alt=\"img_0588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0589.jpg\" alt=\"img_0589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0590.jpg\" alt=\"img_0590\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0591.jpg\" alt=\"img_0591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0593.jpg\" alt=\"img_0593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0595.jpg\" alt=\"img_0595\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/informaticaprojectesara/img_0596.j